"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 41.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 9.7 16.4 16.4 30.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 30.0\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » Ebu Amr, İbni Âmir, hafs rivayetiyle Asım, Hamze kıraetlerinde mansub, mütebakisinde merfu' okunur. Abdullah ibni Mes'ud kıraetinde de «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"151\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 151.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 16.6 16.6 30.0 38.3 38.3 45.7 61.6 61.6 70.6 70.6 82.6 82.6 89.3 96.0 114.0 130.6 130.6 137.3 137.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 30.0 89.3 96.0 114.0\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » idi.</p><p>Cumhurı müfessirîn işbu «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"134\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 133.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.3 25.6 36.0 36.0 44.3 44.3 51.0 59.3 66.0 66.0 81.7 92.3 99.0 99.0 108.0 108.0 115.6 122.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"25.6 44.3 51.0 59.3 81.7 108.0 122.3\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » âyetinin nüzulü evvelkinden mukaddem olduğunu ve fakat tilavette te'hir edildiğini söylemişlerdir. Maamafih tarih, mübeyyen değildir, evvelki iddet, bu da nefaka içindir.</p><p>240.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"299\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 299.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 35.3 42.0 50.3 50.3 58.6 74.3 84.8 93.0 93.0 101.3 110.3 117.0 134.3 134.3 143.3 143.3 155.3 155.3 162.0 162.0 177.8 188.3 188.3 196.6 196.6 203.3 211.6 218.3 218.3 234.0 244.6 251.3 251.3 260.3 260.3 267.8 274.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25